 change to  the model and um  they don't want to see their local  hospital killed even when as many  politicians have said to me that hos  local hospital is literally killing  people they will still present petitions  saying don't close this hospital um  and so uh you know good luck to anyone  who wants to be honest um about the uh  about the  alternative options but i suspect that  uh that they won't get thanked for it  but just  another example from history um kate  used to work for the iea institute of  economic affairs and they got very upset  uh  with enoch powell for saying that there  was no point in um in arguing against  the national health service as it was  because it was something that the public  wanted they wrote to him saying see how  you have comforted our enemy i think you  know if enoch powell had sort of  cottoned on to that then i suspect that  a lot of conservative politicians today  are probably going to draw back and  think now  [Music]  you

